  "text": "Data and Downloads | Board of Elections\nSkip to main content\nAn official website of Mecklenburg County.\nHere\u2019s how you know\nOfficial County websites use MeckNC.gov\nMeckNC.gov\nwebsites belong to official departments or programs of the Mecklenburg County government.\nSecure MeckNC.gov websites use HTTPS\nA\nlock\n(\nLock\nA locked padlock\n) or\nhttps://\nmeans you\u2019ve safely connected to a MeckNC.gov website. Share sensitive information only on official, secure websites.\nResidents\nServices for Me\nBirth and Death Certificates\nMarriage and Divorce Records\nBrowse by Department Listing\nHealth and Human Services\nPark and Recreation\nAccessibility\nGIS & Mapping\nHow do I?\nPay Taxes and Fees\nView Arrest Records\nVote in Mecklenburg County\nWork for Mecklenburg County\nRecycle in Mecklenburg County\nUse the Accessibility Toolbar\nBusinesses\nServices for Businesses\nBusiness Taxes and Fees\nConstruction, Building and Land Development\nEconomic Development\nFood and Facilities Sanitation\nLodging, Childcare and Institutions\nWaste and Recycling\nDoing Business with the County\nVendor Enrollment and Opportunities\nVendor Resources and Support\nGovernment\nCounty Government\nAbout Mecklenburg County\nCounty Manager's Office\nBoard of County Commissioners\nCounty Budget\nCounty Departments\nCommunity Relations\nHow do I?\nDo Business with the County\nRequest a Public Record\nRequest a Speaker\nWatch a BOCC Meeting\nJoin a County Advisory Board or Committee\nPublic Notices\nSearch\nBoard of Elections\nData and Downloads\nSITE MENU\nSite navigation\nBoard of Elections\nInformation On Upcoming Elections\nInformation About Voter Registration\nInformation for Candidates\nData and Downloads\nAbout the Board of Elections\nDepartment Leadership\nOffice Address\nBusiness Office\n741 Kenilworth Ave.\nSuite 202\nCharlotte, NC 28204\nBusiness Hours\nMon-Fri 8 a.m. - 5 p.m.\nContact Info\n704-336-2133\n[email protected]\nData and Downloads\nElection Data\nElection Day Results\nView the official results for previous elections from the North Carolina State Board of Elections database.\nElection Results\nEarly Voting Statistics\nEarly voter data from previous elections.\nEarly Voting Data\nVoter Data\nVoter Registration Statistics Statewide\nVoter Registration Demographic Information by county.\nRegistration Statistics\nVoter Registration Demographics\nInteractive Voter Registration Demographic.\nRegistration Demographics\nData Tools\nVoter Data File\nRegistered voter history for the past twenty elections. Please note this is a large file and can take a long time to download (Is not compatable with Google Chrome)\nVoter Data\nGIS Shape File\nGIS shape files to visualize precincts and jurisdictions. Suitable for use with most GIS tools.\nGIS Shape File\nCampaign Finance Data\nMecklenburg County Campaign Finance Report Search\nCandidates and elected officials for County Commission, Sheriff, School Board, Register of Deeds and City or Town Councils all file campaign finance reports with the Mecklenburg County Board of Elections.\nCounty Reports\nNorth Carolina Campaign Finance Report Search\nCandidates and elected officials for state wide offices, judicial contests, State House and State Senate all file campaign finance reports with the State Board of Elections in Raleigh.\nState Reports\nBoard Meeting Minutes\nPast Meeting Minutes\nIf you need information that is not provided above, or require a different format or method of delivery, fill out the voter records request form.\nVoter Records Request Portal\nBack To Top\nWebsite Information\nBrand Guidelines\nPrivacy and Legal Notices\nSocial Media Accounts\nWeb Accessibility Statement\nGetting Started\nDepartment Directory\nEmployment\nHHS Services\nPay Taxes\nWatch BOCC Broadcasts\nAssistance\nAccessibility Toolbar\nAccessibility\nCharMeck 311\nPublic Record Requests\nRequest a Speaker\nOffice Address\nBusiness Office\n741 Kenilworth Ave.\nSuite 202\nCharlotte, NC 28204\nBusiness Hours\nMon-Fri 8 a.m. - 5 p.m.\nContact Info\n704-336-2133\n[email protected]\nStay connected\nSign-up for email to stay connected to County news.\nSign up\nYour email address\nEmployee Access",
